Test data
---------

Test corpora are used as data only and are not part of the built programs:
Docutils sources (crates/guidedoc-rst/tests/data/docutils: public domain, with one
BSD 2-Clause file), the MyST parser's test data
(crates/guidedoc-commonmark/tests/data/myst: MIT License; see LICENSE there), and the
CommonMark specification 0.31.2 (crates/guidedoc-commonmark/tests/data: CC BY-SA 4.0).
